  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WLCTnCK.png\"></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/WildfireRomeo/WildfireFemaleGenderMod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/github_46h.png\" alt=\"github\" width=\"41\" height=\"40\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/4VDfQu4Wgb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/discord-plural_vector.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"discord-plural\" width=\"242\" height=\"40\"></a>&nbsp; <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/available/modrinth_46h.png\" width=\"225\" height=\"40\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/female-gender\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/supported/fabric_46h.png\" width=\"205\" height=\"40\"></a></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>注意：Forge/NeoForge 版本已不再由我積極維護。社群一直很慷慨地為其提供新版本更新，但如果他們停止，此版本可能也將停止更新。</strong></span><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>不過，我仍積極開發 Fabric 版本！</strong></span></p><p>此模組的主要目標是透過添加胸部來增強 Minecraft 玩家的外觀，提供有別於標準模型的獨特樣貌。</p><p>此模組為客戶端專用。但你可以在伺服器上安裝它，以在玩家之間同步設定。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>自訂盔甲渲染（若安裝模組，單人/多人遊戲皆適用）</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M5bZZfG.png\"></p><p><strong>控制</strong></p><ul>\n<li>G - 開啟女性性別選單</li>\n</ul>",
